Trimesh is a pure Python library for loading and using triangular
meshes, with an emphasis on watertight surfaces.  It provides a fully
featured Trimesh object for easy manipulation and analysis, in the style
of the Polygon object in the Shapely library: import and export of many
formats (STL, OBJ, PLY, GLTF/GLB, OFF, ...), ray tests, boolean and
convex hull helpers, proximity queries and scene graphs.
